 61FE  G 391.3                                                                  
 61FE  L 861.7        (9/2+)                            4        0.38     7     
 61FE cL E$number of |g coincidences with broad proton peak around 1 MeV is     
 61FE2cL much smaller than with rest of proton spectrum, indicating strong      
 61FE3cL contribution for the 862-keV isomeric level.                           

