 61CO c  2017Kl01: E({+238}U)=6.5 MeV/nucleon, target=1.25 mg/cm{+2} thick      
 61CO2c  {+64}Ni. Measured |DE-E energy spectrum for target-like reaction       
 61CO3c  products, mass-over-charge ratio of the ions from tof, E|g, I|g,       
 61CO4c  (recoil ions)|g-coin, level lifetimes by recoil distance Doppler       
 61CO5c  shift (RDDS) method using Orsay universal plunger system (OUPS).       
 61CO6c  Particles were detected using large-acceptance variable mode           
 61CO7c  spectrometer VAMOS++. The Gamma rays were detected using AGATA array of
 61CO8c  19 HPGe crystals at GANIL facility. Deduced levels, B(E2). Comparison  
 61CO9c  with large-scale shell-model calculations, and with beyond-mean-field  
 61COAc  CHFB+5DCH calculations using Gogny D1S interaction                     
 61CO c  Levels and gamma rays shown according to the |g-spectrum shown in      
 61CO2c  Fig. 3 of 2017Kl01                                                     
