 61CU2c  facility. Measured deuteron, triton spectra, |s(|q), spectroscopic     
 61CU3c  factor C{+2}S using a split-pole spectrograph. FWHM |?50 keV for       
 61CU4c  deuterons and |?64 keV for tritons. Target=204 |mg/cm{+2} thick, 99.7% 
 61CU5c  enriched. Deduced levels, J, |p. DWBA analysis.                        
