 61CU c  The uncertainties are estimated to be |?4% for |s>1 mb/sr, |?7% for    
 61CU2c  0.1<|s< 1.0 mb/sr, and |?18% for |s< 0.1 mb/sr at their respective     
 61CU3c  maxima. The uncertainties arising from possible contaminants or        
 61CU4c  previously unidentified states for very weak transitions could be      
 61CU5c  |?0.02 mb/sr.                                                          
